{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108280","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710828001:1":{"text":"我が最も忠実な騎士、レジナルド……どうか、安らかに眠れ。","source_cn":"……安息吧，我最忠诚的骑士，雷吉纳德。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6162B8D8253B61F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710828002:1":{"text":"君の戦いは、もう終わったんだ。","source_cn":"你的战斗，已经结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87AC0FF511947B54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828003:0":{"text":"これで、終わったの……？","source_cn":"我们的战斗赢了吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AEB78B80C4AFEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710828004:1":{"text":"だが、ペギーの問いに答えたのは――","source_cn":"她的问题，没有得到回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA845A4F109C8569A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710828005:1":{"text":"広場を囲むようにして現れた、新たな魔物たちだった。","source_cn":"因为，从广场的四周，传来了新一轮的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383BC19B60759204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710828006:0":{"text":"くそっ！古聖堂からまた魔物が……！","source_cn":"该死！圣古堂的魔物还可能再度出现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E9A683C78DBB8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710828007:0":{"text":"ディアグレスが開いた裂目が、広場でみるみる広がっています！このままでは、民衆が魔物に……！","source_cn":"迪尔格雷打开的裂隙在广场上越来越大！那些魔物…… 它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A496CDDC83D076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1710828007":{"text":"ディアグレスが開いた裂目が、広場でみるみる広がっています！このままでは、民衆が魔物に……！","source_cn":"迪尔格雷打开的裂隙在广场上越来越大！那些魔物…… 它们正冲向那些手无寸铁的民众！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A496CDDC83D076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710828008:0":{"text":"承知しました。マーリン殿、ローランド大帝……！","source_cn":"拜托了，梅林阁下和……罗兰大帝！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE99B0CDB39970BD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"承知しました。マーリン殿、ローランド大帝……！","female":"承知しました。マーリン殿、ローランド大帝……！","variant_male_record_index":"225707","variant_female_record_index":"225708","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710828009:0":{"text":"裂目はお二人にお任せします！ ","source_cn":"这里是战场中心，是裂隙的源头！这里交给你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F1998EE0DAE8708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710